[en.FOCUS_C01_C04_MILITARY_PRESSURE]
Kneel!

[en.FOCUS_C01_C04_MILITARY_PRESSURE_desc]
§g“Found it, it is to the north of Cloudsdale. The governer of Stratusburg seems to be an Imperial Duchess!”§!\n“An Imperial Duchess? In such a small place? Maybe I should get a peerage for myself someday too. Anyway, just send three divisions to the border for a tour. There’s even no need to bother the Minister of Defence, let alone the Empress.”

[zh.FOCUS_C01_C04_MILITARY_PRESSURE]
跪下！

[zh.FOCUS_C01_C04_MILITARY_PRESSURE_desc]
§g“查到了，在云中城北边。层云堡市长好像还是个帝国领主呢！”§!\n“帝国领主？这么个小地方？那我也想给自己整个领主的位置坐坐了。无论如何，派三个师去边境转一圈就好了，别说女皇了，连国防部长都用不着麻烦。”

